{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46879","headline":"荆州新秋寺居写怀诗五首上南平王 一 · 齐己","name":"荆州新秋寺居写怀诗五首上南平王 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹如翡翠侵帘影，苔学琉璃布地纹。\n高卧更无如此乐，远游何必爱他云。\n闲听谢朓吟爲政，静看萧何坐致君。\n只恐老身衰朽速，他年不得颂鸿勳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46879.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46879","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}